{"id":"cf993fca6f67c054","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Second Countable Space","display":"df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space — ZFC Top5 Second Countable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space — ZFC Top5 Second Countable Space","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-second-countable-space — ZFC Top5 Second Countable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"158628923f6edce9\" href=\"?note=158628923f6edce9\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5BaseForTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5BaseForTopology}_S\\)</span> (base predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"158628923f6edce9\" href=\"?note=158628923f6edce9\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> (countable-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SecondCountableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SecondCountableSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}second\\text{-}countable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5SecondCountableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5BaseForTopology}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}second\\text{-}countable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5SecondCountableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5BaseForTopology}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Second countability is the existence of a countable base.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"158628923f6edce9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-top5-base-for-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0